{"event": "LOG_INITIALIZED", "reason": "no_events_yet", "timestamp": 1783558095.9063659, "app_version": "3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3"}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "こんにちはきめっこです。普段", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558111.0934854}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ゲームで英語を使って外国人のふりをしてどっきりを仕掛けている", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558115.340546}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "きみこです。今日はYouTubeJapan公式の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558119.987624}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "チャンネルの場をお借りして、韓国の超有名クリエイターさん", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558123.541409}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "コリアングラマーさんに来ていただました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558128.2781897}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "よろしくお願いします。三時だ。カンパ兄だ。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558131.645264}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は一緒に肉感のお菓子を食べるもっぱんをしていきたいと思います。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558135.4950488}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "あの、すみませ初めて出て", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558144.230461}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "では早速食べていきましょう。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558148.2073257}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "こちらがですね抹茶クリームサンドで", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558151.3654463}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "私のチャンネルが英語と日本語を使って動画", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558155.2895162}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "をいろいろ撮影しているので和洋折衷のお菓子を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558159.0476718}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ご用意させていたきました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558163.3911688}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "くだい。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558171.3985052}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "す。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558183.5683157}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "私のチャンネルについてなんですけど、私はよくゲームで野良のプレイ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558187.1813595}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に英語で話しかけてイギリス人のふりをしたり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558192.0974352}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "人の振りをしてどっきりを仕掛けて最後に私にやっぱり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558196.6136549}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "日本人なんですよ実はってばらしてなんかびっくりさせる動画が多い", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558201.1147573}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "んですよね。良かったなか受けてる。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558205.9239008}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。取が。。級なんだ。。ただきます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558213.8386924}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "黒け。ぼっきいところ飲んで、逃げ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558218.4743962}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "こり言とペットについてきた。思うじゃわよ。しほのご", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558223.2055025}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "もしろの塩。美味しいです。しかも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558231.5115955}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "食感が豆腐じゃないけど面白い", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558235.1654735}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "食感でばカルロいゆばまぬんばよ。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558238.4771812}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "僕聞いた子湯がとまんでる子。で、ピプがたらその子どうもしろの子。飲むちょわ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558241.8395324}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "よ。そうなんですね。結構乾燥肌なので、乾燥肌にも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558246.7760618}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "良かったりするんですかね。ゆくたら大丈夫か。ああ、いいんですか。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558251.2415478}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "んですか。わあ、すごい。鳥取はポットム鳥取があるんや。三十", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558255.2744703}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "の鳥取や。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558260.1439133}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "てあげたりですよ。ゲームを始めたのはコロナが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558268.400611}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "流行り始めた時にずっと家で引きこもってて暇になったのでゲーム", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558271.824426}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "してみようかなって思って。元々ゲーム全くしない人だっんですよ。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558276.506987}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "よ。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558280.854755}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "うまくないですよこれがでもありがとうございますうまくなります", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558284.5082412}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ダグランドセフトオートだ。一回だけやったことあ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558297.0764647}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。手羽木らんご、どうもいたあれ。なぜYouTube始めたんですかそりゃ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558301.2532387}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "か", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558305.800109}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。肌、哺乳化、欲かい、汗をよ。いいですね。なんかやっぱり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558318.6592937}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "活発に動いた方が体にもいいですし。日本", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558322.529355}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "のゼット世代に人気のお菓子ですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558326.374662}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "神高かっていう神高万能子よ。そうですそう", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558329.7874067}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "です。今期間限定でこちらのヤンニョムチキンの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558333.1846466}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "味がたまたま出てて、ぜひ味見してほしいです。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558337.4429855}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ヤンニョムチキンの味します。まさにの旦那", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558342.4677749}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ヤンニョッチク", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558350.3109353}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "食べたい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558355.3531377}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "しそう。ちっちゃいドーナツみたいで小腹", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558371.371109}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "空いた時にあの鞄からすって食べれるので。兄妹こそチョコも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558374.7384462}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いっぱ食べれます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558378.9313438}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いっぱいおいい。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558382.3132787}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いっぱい最初半分もないよ。どの年代", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558385.7473972}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "の視聴者さが多いんですか二時いて、三時いって。そうなんですね。幅広く", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558389.0574937}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "二十代。私二十六歳なので私くらいの年代の人が。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558393.6281378}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "見てた。山澤さん、出たにね。そうです、もうファンです。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558397.637281}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "おるこかね。さらしを。ひめこさん", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558401.8800187}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。の世代より若い", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558406.2839954}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "人が多いですかね、多分。なので18歳くらい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558409.4598572}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "はお菓子を通じて、日刊と", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558416.438152}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "世代交流ができて本当に楽しかったです。コリアン・グラマーさん本当", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558419.7440546}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ありがとうございました。ちょうど飲もうかんざいですわよ。ちびこさんの俺真ん中こう", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558423.846883}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ちんちゃいるものなかこうちんちゃいるものに気分となご", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558428.271825}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ちちゃい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558432.1476257}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いっぱい今じゃさじゅっけと言う", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558440.0604086}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ことでまたお会いできる日を楽しみにしてみ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558446.3772197}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ます。ありがとうございした。バイバイ。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558449.5905392}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.3-20260709-094815-61e27463", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ございました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783558456.3841286}
